w: Here is hope for all who grieve— Je- sus sin- ners doth re- ceive.
w: Who with hum- ble hearts be- lieve\- Je- sus sin- ners doth re- ceive. 
w: In His arms that they may live— Je- sus sin- ners doth re- ceive.
w: Firm- ly in these words be- lieve: Je- sus sin- ners doth re- ceive.
w: Let these words my soul re- lieve: Je- sus sin- ners doth re- ceive.
w: For these words I now be- lieve: Je- sus sin- ners doth re- ceive.
w: Naught re- mains my soul to grieve— Je- sus sin- ners doth re- ceive.
w: Dy- ing, still to Him I cleave— Je- sus sin- ners doth re- ceive.
